{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1395404-rise-of-the-rossellini","id":1395404,"title":"Rise of the Rossellini","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-09T11:31:35-07:00","id":1395404,"title":"Rise of the Rossellini","content":"I\u2019ve always been a big fan of Revenants. I was just reading up on the Rossellini Revenant family and saw that the family has a very long history, going back to Rome as Necromancers and that Cappadocious was interested in them before the Giovanni. They were more skilled Necromancers than the Giovanni, but somehow the Giovanni managed to maneuver into the better position and ultimately force the Rossellini family into subservience - which must have been a bitter pill for them.<br /> <br /> Now the Giovanni Clan has fallen, maybe it is time for the Rossellini family to rise to a place of prominence within the Hecata, or maybe within some other vampiric organization. Could could be both a vampiric bloodline and a Revenant family. Maybe an alliance with other old Giovanni families could be interesting, like the Dunsirn.<br /> <br /> Where could we go with this idea?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-09T12:07:17-07:00","id":1395415,"title":"","content":"If the Sabbat were still a going concern, I suppose the Rossellini would be a top contender for the faction of Giovanni most likely to join the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> In the canon continuity of V5, the Hecata have dislodged the literal Giovanni family from their central role in the clan. This can only be good for the rest of the surviving members of the old Clan Giovanni. Everyone with the wrong last name was at a disadvantage in the old days.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11558-nosimplehiway","name":"Nosimplehiway","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11558_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-09T12:15:55-07:00","id":1395421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1395404-rise-of-the-rossellini#post1395404\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019ve always been a big fan of Revenants. I was just reading up on the Rossellini Revenant family and saw that the family has a very long history, going back to Rome as Necromancers and that Cappadocious was interested in them before the Giovanni. They were more skilled Necromancers than the Giovanni, but somehow the Giovanni managed to maneuver into the better position and ultimately force the Rossellini family into subservience - which must have been a bitter pill for them.<br /> <br /> Now the Giovanni Clan has fallen, maybe it is time for the Rossellini family to rise to a place of prominence within the Hecata, or maybe within some other vampiric organization. Could could be both a vampiric bloodline and a Revenant family. Maybe an alliance with other old Giovanni families could be interesting, like the Dunsirn.<br /> <br /> Where could we go with this idea?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Giovanni have not fallen, they have &quot;merged&quot; with other bloodlines related to the clan of death but still are the most influential bloodline in the clan. That said, the other Giovanni families have much more of a leeway now than they had under Augustus' and his cronies so they have a lot of freedom to pursue their interests, in case of the Rossellini that was Necromancy, which still is the Giovanni speciality within the Hecata (Necromancy specialized in summoning and controlling ghosts to be precise) so they could become contenders for the Giovanni's role as the official leaders of the clan. I don't know if they want to become the &quot;faces&quot; of the Hecata though. I feel like part of the reason the other bloodlines accepted leaving the Giovanni in a lead position because that also left the Giovanni exposed while they could pursue their studies and goals without risk of immediate retribution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-09T19:56:00-07:00","id":1395510,"title":"","content":"The Giovanni Clan has lost its power but the Giovanni family and bloodline is now a powerful part of the Hecata Blood Cult (not sect or Clan).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}